<title>CHINA: TERMBRAY INDUSTRIES YEAR NET UP 11.8 PCT.</title>
<headline>TERMBRAY INDUSTRIES YEAR NET UP 11.8 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	90.7	 vs 81.1 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents) 8.0	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     16.09 loss vs 9.40 loss</p>
<p>    Net			 136.48     vs 122.06</p>
<p>    Turnover		  1,282.80   vs 1,193.72</p>
<p>    Company name	    Termbray Industries International</p>
<p>				  (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close	     September 12-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	to be announced</p>
<p>NOTE - Termbray Industries manufactures and markets high-precision printed circuit boards and makes consumer electronic products.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on provision for inventories and factory relocation expenses.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings have been adjusted for the bonus issues of shares made during the year.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is eight H.K. cents vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
